config ZEPHYR_JPEGDEC_MODULE
	bool

config JPEGDEC
	bool "JPEGDEC software JPEG decoder"
	depends on ZEPHYR_JPEGDEC_MODULE
	help
	  Software JPEG decoder from the jpegdec module. It decodes baseline
	  JPEG images, optionally cropped or scaled to 1/2, 1/4 or 1/8, and
	  decodes progressive images at 1/8 scale only. The decoder keeps its
	  state in a caller-owned structure and does not allocate memory.
